  "reason": "RNA-only PCA results show multiprofile avgpool is clearly the best RNA setting (0.591 accuracy vs 0.485 singleprofile and 0.519 transformer), but there is no evidence yet for the image modality. config_011 tests image-only ResNet50 under the same multiprofile avgpool setting, isolating the image representation without introducing fusion. This establishes whether image can be competitive with the RNA baseline and whether multimodal fusion is worth pursuing, making it a high-value, low-confound use of the next budgeted experiment."
